		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>In this paper, we introduce the subfield bilinear collision problem and use it to construct an identification protocol and a signature scheme. This construction is based on the MPC-in-the-head paradigm and uses the Fiat-Shamir transformation to obtain a signature.</p>
			</abstract>
